@startuml Chat with Group by User
actor User
participant ": ChatDetailPage " as ChatDetailPage
participant ": ChatHub (SignalR) " as ChatHub
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ChatController " as ChatController
participant ": HttpContextService " as HttpContextService
participant ": ChatService " as ChatService
participant ": ChatRepository " as ChatRepository
participant ": UserService " as UserService
participant ": NotificationService " as NotificationService
database Database

User->ChatDetailPage: 1. Type message and click Send
    activate User
    activate ChatDetailPage

ChatDetailPage->ChatDetailPage: 2. Validate message (not empty)

ChatDetailPage->ChatHub: 3. SendMessage(roomId, userId, content, "text")
    activate ChatHub
    deactivate ChatDetailPage

ChatHub->ChatHub: 4. Create ChatMessage object

ChatHub->ChatHub: 5. Broadcast to room group (all participants)
ChatHub-->ChatDetailPage: 6. ReceiveMessage (realtime)
    activate ChatDetailPage
    deactivate ChatHub

ChatDetailPage->ChatDetailPage: 7. Add message to UI (optimistic update)

ChatDetailPage->Router: 8. Send POST /api/chat/messages/{roomId} with messageData
    deactivate ChatDetailPage
    activate Router

Router->ChatController: 9. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate ChatController

ChatController->HttpContextService: 10. GetCurrentUserId()
    activate HttpContextService
    deactivate ChatController

HttpContextService->HttpContextService: 11. Extract userId from JWT token
HttpContextService-->ChatController: 12. Return userId
    activate ChatController
    deactivate HttpContextService

ChatController->ChatController: 13. Set message.SenderId, message.Timestamp, message.RoomId

ChatController->ChatService: 14. SendMessage(message)
    deactivate ChatController
    activate ChatService

ChatService->ChatRepository: 15. AddMessage(message)
    activate ChatRepository

ChatRepository->Database: 16. INSERT ChatMessage into MongoDB
    activate Database

Database-->ChatRepository: 17. Message saved
    deactivate Database

ChatRepository->ChatRepository: 18. Get ChatRoom by RoomId

ChatRepository->Database: 19. Query ChatRoom WHERE Id = roomId
    activate Database

Database-->ChatRepository: 20. Return ChatRoom (with all ParticipantIds)
    deactivate Database

ChatRepository->ChatRepository: 21. Loop through all ParticipantIds (except sender)

loop for each participant (except sender)
    ChatRepository->ChatRepository: 22. Increment UnreadCounts[participantId]
end

ChatRepository->Database: 23. UPDATE ChatRoom SET UnreadCounts for all recipients
    activate Database

Database-->ChatRepository: 24. Room updated
    deactivate Database

ChatRepository-->ChatService: 25. Return saved ChatMessage
    deactivate ChatRepository

ChatService->UserService: 26. GetUserByIdAsync(senderId)
    activate UserService

UserService->Database: 27. Query User by Id
    activate Database

Database-->UserService: 28. Return User data
    deactivate Database

UserService-->ChatService: 29. Return User (FullName, AvatarUrl)
    deactivate UserService

ChatService->ChatRepository: 30. GetRoomById(roomId)
    activate ChatRepository

ChatRepository->Database: 31. Query ChatRoom by Id
    activate Database

Database-->ChatRepository: 32. Return ChatRoom
    deactivate Database

ChatRepository-->ChatService: 33. Return ChatRoom
    deactivate ChatRepository

ChatService->NotificationService: 34. AddAsync(Notification) for recipients
    activate NotificationService

loop for each recipient
    NotificationService->Database: 35. INSERT Notification for recipient
        activate Database
    Database-->NotificationService: 36. Notification created
        deactivate Database
end

NotificationService-->ChatService: 37. Return
    deactivate NotificationService

ChatService-->ChatController: 38. Return saved ChatMessage
    activate ChatController
    deactivate ChatService

ChatController-->Router: 39. Send Success Response
    activate Router
    deactivate ChatController

Router-->ChatDetailPage: 40. Message saved successfully
    activate ChatDetailPage
    deactivate Router

ChatDetailPage->ChatDetailPage: 41. Clear input field

ChatDetailPage->ChatDetailPage: 42. Scroll to bottom

ChatDetailPage-->User: 43. Show message in group chat
    deactivate ChatDetailPage
    deactivate User
@enduml




